n grid on the right (Lawton/Moraga/Noriega/Ortega St, 8th-10th Ave). Zoning borders are heavy (5-8 px) lines; they run down the streets just beside a block's thin line (e.g. around 2034A at x 505-520, the curving street west of 1928B/2052A at x 304-416, x 579-586 beside 1858/1931, y 1980-1984 between 1862A and 1927A, the RH-1(D) line around 1860B at y ~1880-1900, x 752-757 beside 2047, x 917-922 beside 1935) or cut through blocks (1858 P-box, 1860A, 1861B, 2034A, 2036A-2040). I tell them apart by width; every outline is on the street-side edge of the block's own thin line, never on a heavy line beside it. Method: for each block I chose by eye which pieces of paper belong to it (across the heavy lines and letters that cut it) and which thin line is its outline; the outline's exact position (outer edge of that thin line) was then measured from page.png with a helper and checked by eye on 3-6x close-ups with the outline drawn over the scan. Judgment calls (page coordinates): (1) 1861A and 1861B share one thin diagonal line from (322,1855) to (411,1878); typed a pixel apart, 1861A above. The area under that line with the RH-1(D) lettering (x 320-411, y 1856-1890) is taken as the top of 1861B; it could instead be street. (2) The narrow lane between 1861A and 1860A (x 413-421) is taken to run down to Aloha Ave behind the '(D)' letters (y 1855-1880), where its lines are hidden. (3) 1928A's north-east side from (384,2015) to (424,2048) is hidden under the letter 'R' of RH-1; typed along the left side of the letter strokes; the letter's bowl and leg gap (x 404-428, y 2019-2043) are left as street. (4) 2034A (Grand View Park, P) is one block made of the park and the land south of the P border down to Noriega St; the short two-line notch from Noriega at x 447-458, y 2212-2245 and the narrow two-line stub at x 480-510, y 2157-2166 are left as street (path-like, open to the street). (5) The checker pattern at the SW corner of 2039 (x 758-775, y 2318-2337) is taken as block. (6) Lines hidden under heavy lines are typed through the middle of the heavy line: west edge of 1859A (x ~540), 1858 under the P-box top (y 1862-1866). (7) At the bottom edge, the lower line of the slanting street south of 2049B runs on from (644,2519) down-left to the box edge at about (595,2539); it is the top side of a block under the big letters RH-1, typed as cut by the box, its east side put at x 648 along Pacheco St, whose west line is hidden under the H's stem (x 641-651) there, so that side is uncertain by about 3 px; the block east of Pacheco St at x 655-740, y 2490-2539 (2123A) is typed as cut by the box. The blocks south of Ortega St start at y ~2538 and are not typed (1-2 px). Right edge: 1854, 1935, 2041 and 2045 are cut by the box at x 949.", "drawn_by": "Claude (AI): blocks, and which thin line outlines each, chosen by eye on ruled close-ups; line positions traced from page.png with a helper; checked by eye on outline-over-scan close-ups and the labels picture, 2026-11-23"}